Title: Numerical Transformations For Vectors
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Sambhav", "Goyal", , "sambhav.goyal@ubc.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions for transforming and scaling numeric vectors using different mathematical approaches. This package has functions on common transformation procedures such as min-max transformation, Z-score based normal transformation, and logarithm based min-max transformation.
